<p>i really like it, it feels unique! i can see it being great!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;LETS&nbsp;GOOO</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;LETS&nbsp;GO&nbsp;BAACK</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>It can think and feel questioning it own existence; it's own uncertainties of it's life and possible death. Millions of pages in 7 different languages document its journeys, it's feelings, people it has met and events it has witnessed. Besides it's discovery during WW2 and it's clinical description the article would include some of it's writings.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>i really like it. it makes the SCP more of a character than a item!<br />
however does the person whose that is using the pen conscious? or they just feel like wanting to write it thoughts? why is that happen?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Users of the pen express either &quot;euphoric shock&quot; or dysphoria upon realization of the situation. Some even saying the jewel on the top of the pen is so beautiful that they must use it.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Why is that though? the pen didn't wanted to hurt them so it created this euphoric feeling?<br />
i think this one should be explained more!</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Some experiences it has had include:</p>
<p>Times of War<br />
Being the Object of Worship by cults<br />
Being helpless to save someone</p>
</blockquote>
<p>why the sudden change of tone? it feels as though it wasn't that dangerous, then it did! what do you mean by Time of was as in WW2 ? is it referencing that?<br />
i actually like the idea that its used as an object that worshiped by a cult, i think you should dealt into it more.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The feeling of euphoria has lead to people making cults surrounding the pen.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>yup i like the idea I think you should again build into the idea!</p>
<p>overall i actually agree with Caspian2 on the other parts.</p>
<p>I bid you a good day!<br />
PS: like your ticktock!</p>
</div>
